# Title: Non-privileged Usage of Reg or Powershell
# ID: 8f02c935-effe-45b3-8fc9-ef8696a9e41d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Ryan Plas (rule), oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-05
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Search for usage of reg or Powershell by non-privileged users to modify service configuration in registry
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine contains "reg " AND CommandLine contains "add")) OR ((CommandLine contains "powershell" OR CommandLine contains "set-itemproperty" OR CommandLine contains " sp " OR CommandLine contains "new-itemproperty"))) AND ((IntegrityLevel equals "Medium" OR IntegrityLevel equals "S-1-16-8192") AND (CommandLine contains "ControlSet" AND CommandLine contains "Services") AND (CommandLine contains "ImagePath" OR CommandLine contains "FailureCommand" OR CommandLine contains "ServiceDLL")))
